# Basic constraint annotation test
# Verifies Comparable constraint is attached to TypeVar 'a'
[
  MyClass: [class [let MyClass a]]
  MyClassInt: [instance MyClass [pattern [Int]]:]
  constrained-fn: [fn@[return: a  constraint: [a: MyClass]] [let x@a] x]
  result: [constrained-fn 42]
]

---

%.result
=== out
Int(42)
